SUMMARY:The Brakeman’s Curse at Strasburg Rail Road
DESCRIPTION:Running September 25 – October 25 \nIt is the grand reopening of the historic rail car that was involved in a mysterious crash 40 years ago. Since then\, tales of a curse have followed it wherever it goes. From simple accidents to unexplained disappearances\, this car seems to spell disaster for all who ride it. \nThis 1980’s style show with a cast of memorable characters will show you mystery\, adventure and maybe even a little fright as you speed down the rails on an adventure to uncover the source of a 40-year-old curse. Join us\, if you dare\, as we make this historic journey once more down these hollowed tracks and see if you will be spared from “The Brakeman’s Curse”. \nOur show will begin 15 minutes prior to departure aboard our beautiful\, newly renovated Marian\, car #88. So please arrive 30 minutes before the hour to ensure a smooth boarding process. Guests will be able to place their orders with our onboard server before the show begins so you won’t miss even one second of showtime! Climb aboard for this thrilling 45- murder mystery experience\, only at the Strasburg Rail Road.
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/brakemans-curse-strasburg-rail-road/
LOCATION:Strasburg Rail Road\, 301 Gap Road\, Ronks\, PA\, 17572\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults Only,Autumn,Halloween,Murder Mystery,Railroad,Strasburg, PA
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/strasburg-rail-road-event-brakemans-curse.webp
GEO:39.9830724;-76.1597641
