SUMMARY:Beautiful: The Carole King Musical - Dutch Apple Dinner Theatre
DESCRIPTION:This inspiring true story about Carole King spans from her early days as a Brooklyn teenager struggling to enter the record business to her years spent as a chart-topping musical legend. Hear So Far Away\, Natural Woman\, One Fine Day\, It’s Too Late\, and more. PG 13 \nApproximate Run Time: 2 Hours and 30 Minutes\n\nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
