SUMMARY:Trains & Treats at Railroad Museum of PA
DESCRIPTION:Kids pick up a treat bag and follow the Treat Trail set up in the Railroad Museum of Pennsylvania\, where they experience historic locomotives\, railroad cars and interactive  exhibits inside Rolling Stock Hall. Each of the 10 stops along the Treat Trail will have a candy and a non-candy treat for kids to enjoy. All edible treats are nut-free. \nKids can come to Trains & Treats in their favorite familyfriendly costume\, if they like! \nTrains & Treats is recommended for children ages 3 to 12 and is included in the regular Museum admission. \nPurchase tickets in advance on the Museum’s website or at the door.
