SUMMARY:AppleUmpkin Festival
DESCRIPTION:Fall Fun With a Purpose\nThe AppleUmpkin Festival is more than just a fall festival. It’s a community tradition that brings together local makers\, small businesses\, families\, and neighbors for a day of seasonal celebration. \nEvery vendor booth visited\, every apple dumpling purchased\, and every activity enjoyed helps support future community programs and events hosted by Adamstown Community Days throughout the year. \nWhether you’re shopping for unique handmade gifts\, enjoying live entertainment\, or simply spending time with family and friends\, you’re helping strengthen our community!
