SUMMARY:Live Music with Mark DeRose at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Check out our amazing line up of musicians that will be performing live right here at the farm! \nJoin us select Friday evenings and Saturdays for toe tapping tunes from our favorite bands. \nThe music calls upon DeRose’s love for rootsy blue-eyed soul and classic rock of the late 60s and 70s. Willing and ready to perform his mix of both originals and covers\, Mark is musically pliable and able to entertain a wide variety of audiences. \n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
