SUMMARY:Harvest Fest at Nissley Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the winery on Saturday\, October 17th! \nCatch live music from Beka Jones from 12:00 – 2:30 and Matt Miskie from 3:00 – 6:00. \nEnjoy local food trucks\, lawn games\, a vendor market\, Nissley wines\, local craft beers\, and our People’s Choice Pumpkin Decorating Contest! \nWarm Spicy Red & Spiced Apple Wines will be available! \nAdmission is free and all ages are welcome! Pet-friendly. \nBring a lawn chair/blanket. BYO food is welcome.
